msgid "Refresh device status"
msgstr "Segarkan status perangkat"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Game / Chat audio"
msgstr "Audio Game / Chat"

msgid "Checking for the PC-mode dongle…"
msgstr "Mencari dongle dalam mode PC…"

msgid "Overall volume"
msgstr "Volume keseluruhan"

msgid "Limits the louder Game/Chat endpoint. At center, both use this volume."
msgstr ""
"Membatasi saluran Game/Chat yang lebih keras. Di tengah, keduanya memakai "
"volume ini."

msgid "Center"
msgstr "Tengahkan"

msgid "Set Game and Chat to the same volume (balance 50)"
msgstr "Atur Game dan Chat ke volume yang sama (keseimbangan 50)"

msgid "Boost Chat"
msgstr "Perkuat Chat"

msgid ""
"Set Chat to 70% and Game to 30%; press again to restore the volumes from "
"before"
msgstr ""
"Atur Chat ke 70% dan Game ke 30%; tekan lagi untuk memulihkan volume "
"sebelumnya"

msgid "Game / Chat balance"
msgstr "Keseimbangan Game / Chat"

msgid "0 = Chat, 50 = both equally, 100 = Game"
msgstr "0 = Chat, 50 = keduanya sama, 100 = Game"

msgid "Chat"
msgstr "Chat"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "Keduanya"

msgid "Game"
msgstr "Game"

msgid "Microphone volume"
msgstr "Volume mikrofon"

msgid "Input level sent to voice applications."
msgstr "Level input yang dikirim ke aplikasi suara."

msgid "Use Game output + INZONE microphone"
msgstr "Gunakan output Game + mikrofon INZONE"

msgid "Start at login in the tray"
msgstr "Mulai saat masuk di baki sistem"

msgid "Tray integration: checking…"
msgstr "Integrasi baki: memeriksa…"

msgid "Tray integration active — closing hides this window."
msgstr "Integrasi baki aktif — menutup akan menyembunyikan jendela ini."

msgid "Tray icon unavailable — install/enable AppIndicator support in GNOME."
msgstr ""
"Ikon baki tidak tersedia — pasang/aktifkan dukungan AppIndicator di GNOME."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio control error: {message}"
msgstr "Kesalahan kontrol audio: {message}"

msgid "● INZONE Buds connected in PC mode"
msgstr "● INZONE Buds terhubung dalam mode PC"

msgid ""
"INZONE Buds PC-mode endpoints are unavailable. Connect the dongle with its "
"switch set to PC."
msgstr ""
"Endpoint mode PC INZONE Buds tidak tersedia. Hubungkan dongle dengan sakelar "
"di posisi PC."

msgid "another device"
msgstr "perangkat lain"

msgid "INZONE microphone"
msgstr "mikrofon INZONE"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Game {game}%  ·  Chat {chat}%  ·  Default output: {output}  ·  Default "
"input: {input}"
msgstr ""
"Game {game}%  ·  Chat {chat}%  ·  Output bawaan: {output}  ·  Input bawaan: "
"{input}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "could not change the login setting: {error}"
msgstr "tidak dapat mengubah pengaturan saat masuk: {error}"

msgid "Show Window"
msgstr "Tampilkan jendela"

msgid "Center Game/Chat"
msgstr "Tengahkan Game/Chat"

msgid "Boost Chat 70%"
msgstr "Perkuat Chat 70%"

msgid "INZONE Buds connected"
msgstr "INZONE Buds terhubung"

msgid "Game and Chat are ready."
msgstr "Game dan Chat siap."

msgid "INZONE Buds disconnected"
msgstr "INZONE Buds terputus"

msgid "INZONE Buds Mixer"
msgstr "INZONE Buds Mixer"

msgid "Control Game, Chat and microphone levels for INZONE Buds"
msgstr "Kontrol level Game, Chat, dan mikrofon untuk INZONE Buds"

msgid "INZONE;Buds;Game;Chat;Audio;Mixer;"
msgstr "INZONE;Buds;Game;Chat;Audio;Mixer;"

msgid "Control the native Game, Chat and microphone endpoints on Linux"
msgstr "Kontrol endpoint bawaan Game, Chat, dan mikrofon di Linux"

msgid ""
"INZONE Buds Mixer is an unofficial open-source controller for the Sony "
"INZONE Buds USB dongle in PC mode. It adjusts the native Game and Chat "
"balance, overall playback level and microphone level through PipeWire."
msgstr ""
"INZONE Buds Mixer adalah pengontrol sumber terbuka tidak resmi untuk dongle "
"USB Sony INZONE Buds dalam mode PC. Aplikasi ini mengatur keseimbangan Game "
"dan Chat bawaan, level pemutaran keseluruhan, dan level mikrofon melalui "
"PipeWire."

msgid ""
"This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Sony. INZONE and Sony are "
"trademarks of their respective owner."
msgstr ""
"Proyek ini tidak berafiliasi dengan Sony dan tidak didukung oleh Sony. "
"INZONE dan Sony adalah merek dagang dari pemiliknya masing-masing."
